  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nDeathOmen is a short psychological horror game that challenges players to maintain their sanity over the nights in a mysterious  house that hides mystery and fear. It’s a journey of constant change, full of disturbing events and jump scares.<p></p>\n<p>Dive into an atmospheric first-person experience where every shadow holds a secret, and every sound hints at your doom. DeathOmen isn’t just a game—it’s a test of courage, endurance, and the human spirit. Will you survive the night?</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A Journey of Mystery and Madness: Expect the unexpected at every turn.\n</li><li>Jump-Scares and Microscares: From heart-stopping moments to subtle, creeping horrors, DeathOmen keeps you on edge with relentless psychological scares.\n</li><li>Play as Yourself: Step into the shoes of your psyche. The fears your character faces mirror your own. Are you brave enough to face them?\n</li><li>Nightmarish Survival Mechanics: Spend some nights in a house filled with unknown horrors. Stay awake to fend off the torment of sleep paralysis.\n</li></ul>\n",
